benchmarks/subset -- the programs of scripts/run_full_evaluation.sh --subset
=============================================================================

  ulr_vs_pulr/   100 programs drawn at random from benchmarks/ulr_vs_pulr, for [1] (Table 1, Figure 5)
  ulr_vs_upl/    100 programs drawn at random from benchmarks/ulr_vs_upl, for [2] (Figure 6)

Each README says how its programs were drawn and gives our result for each of them.
